# --- News Trending & Emerging Events engine (scripts/20_news_run.py). READ-ONLY sources. -----------------
# Credentials come ONLY from the environment / an env file - never hardcode them. Either:
#   NEWS_ENV_FILE=/path/to/an/existing/.env    (it may define SOURCE_DATABASE_URL and OPENSEARCH_*)
# or set these (no defaults are applied; a missing value is a hard error):
NEWS_PG_HOST=
NEWS_PG_PORT=
NEWS_PG_USER=
NEWS_PG_PASSWORD=
NEWS_PG_DB=shaktidb_news
NEWS_OS_URL=
NEWS_OS_USER=
NEWS_OS_PASSWORD=
NEWS_OS_VERIFY_CERTS=true
# Optional: which derived database the dashboard serves (default: news_metrics.duckdb if present, else the pilot DB)
# NEWS_UI_DB=data/news_pilot_india_bangladesh.duckdb
